source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: `&#92;` shows the authored backslash while the escapes beside it still protect the braces, which is exactly what the renderer emits for the text `C:\{x}`.
-- input.jira --
C:&#92;\{x\}
-- rendered.html --
<p>C:&#92;{x}</p>
-- want.md --
C:&#92;{x}
-- warnings.json --
[]
